## ObjectType: Opening Position

Opening inventory and local unit cost before the first transaction month. It is a stock balance, not a trade.

Local operational extension; no FIBO equivalence asserted.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| opening_id | Opening Id | string | Stable unique identifier of this business record. | opening_id |
| account_id | Account Id | string | Foreign key to accounts; blank only where contract declares absent/inapplicable evidence. | account_id |
| instrument_id | Instrument Id | string | Foreign key to financial_instruments; blank only where contract declares absent/inapplicable evidence. | instrument_id |
| opening_date | Opening Date | date | Date of opening ledger balance before the first sample trade; not an execution date. | opening_date |
| quantity | Quantity | decimal | Positive business quantity in the linked instrument’s share or face units. | quantity |
| cost_unit_price | Cost Unit Price | decimal | Local-currency quote in the linked instrument basis; apply price_multiplier. | cost_unit_price |
| currency | Currency | string | Instrument denomination; must agree across trade, instruction, opening and position. | currency |

### Keys

Primary Keys: opening_id
Display Key: opening_id
